\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. ACCORDING to Thy gracious word,
\par In meek humility,
\par This will I do, my dying Lord,
\par I will remember Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thy body, broken for my sake,
\par My bread from heaven shall be;
\par Thy testamental cup I take,
\par And thus remember Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. When to the Cross I turn mine eyes,
\par And rest on Calvary,
\par O Lamb of God, my sacrifice,
\par I must remember Thee-
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Remember Thee, and all Thy pains,
\par And all Thy love to me;
\par Yea, while a breath, a pulse remains,
\par Will I remember Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. And when these falling lips grow dumb,
\par And mind and memory flee,
\par When Thou shalt in Thy kingdom come,
\par Jesus, remember me.
\par                    Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

